      "role": "user",
      "content": "the coffee thing feels like such a cope though. like, why bother with a tiny moment of warmth if the end result is just total nothingness? it feels like we're just pretending that small things matter so we don't have to face the reality that it's all just a meaningless accident. if the outcome is always zero, then the effort is just... wasted energy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
